从系统架构角度拆解：
四种范式在系统中的交互模式：
```
Task Offload:
  Core → invoke → Engine(execute action near data) → Future → Core(result)
  通信：请求-响应模式，短延迟要求
  示例：atomicAdd on remote cache line

Long-lived:
  Core → spawn → Engine(run long thread) ... Engine完成 → notify Core
  通信：独立执行，仅最终通知
  示例：packet serialization near memory

Data-triggered:
  Cache miss/eviction → trigger → Engine(constructor/destructor)
  通信：无core参与，纯硬件事件驱动
  示例：decompression on cache fill, prefetch on miss pattern

Streaming:
  Core(Consumer) ← phantom loads ← Engine(Producer, long-lived)
  Engine push → circular buffer → data-triggered copy → Core consume
  通信：持续单向数据流，backpressure through buffer
  示例：BDFS graph edge generation → PageRank processing
```
