四种范式在系统中的交互模式：
```
Task Offload:  Core→invoke→Engine(execute near data)→Future→Core(result)
Long-lived:    Core→spawn→Engine(independent thread)...notify Core
Data-triggered: Cache miss→trigger→Engine(constructor/destructor)
Streaming:     Engine(Producer)→circular buffer→phantom load→Core(Consumer)
```
Cross-paradigm组合：(a) PHI = Task Offload (RMW) + Data-triggered (write-combining on eviction)；(b) Stream实现 = Long-lived (producer) + Data-triggered (phantom→buffer copy)；(c) NSC风格 = Task Offload + Streaming。

