## Actor-based Reactive Programming for NDC

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Actor-based Reactive Programming for NDC是Leviathan (MICRO 2024) 为统一四个NDC范式设计的编程模型。在actor-based reactive programming中，actor是封装了数据和关联action的对象，action由外部trigger调用。Leviathan将其适配到NDC：actor=NDC操作的target data+近数据执行的functions，trigger=paradigm-specific事件（invoke call / cache insertion/eviction / stream push）。Programmer只需：(a) 定义actor class实现action method；(b) 使用Allocator<T>分配actor objects；(c) 通过invoke/register/genStream触发action——hardware details (cache line size, alignment, bank mapping, action location)完全transparent。

从系统架构角度拆解：
Actor interface在四种范式的统一表达：
```
// Task Offload & Long-lived:
class MyActor {
  int data;
  ResultType action(Args args) { /* compute on this.data */ }
};
MyActor* a = Allocator<MyActor>::allocate();
Future<ResultType> f = invoke a->action(args);
ResultType r = f.wait();

// Data-triggered:
class MyActor {
  int data;
  MyActor(Morph<MyActor>* view) { /* constructor */ }
  ~MyActor(Morph<MyActor>* view, bool isDirty) { /* destructor */ }
};
Morph<MyActor>::register(type, LLC, numActors);
// Allocation & trigger auto-managed by cache controller

// Streaming:
class MyStream extends Stream<Edge> {
  void genStream() { /* producer: */ while(..) push(edge); }
};
MyStream stream(bufSize);
Future<Edge> f = stream.next(); Edge e = f.wait(); processEdge(e);
```
统一接口关键收益：(a) programmer学一套actor概念即可用所有范式；(b) cross-paradigm interaction自然——PHI的task-offload action触发data-triggered constructor无需glue code；(c) memory management统一——Allocator<T>处理padding/bank mapping/compaction。

术语一般如何实现？如何使用？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
实现：actor class编译为常规C++ class，action method编译为engine dataflow fabric可执行的指令序列。invoke keyword→invoke ISA指令。Morph::register→TLB bits+cache tag bits标记phantom address range。Stream继承Morph，额外管理circular buffer。Allocator: pool-based, contiguous physical memory, offset计算做cache↔DRAM翻译。对比täkō：data-triggered接口暴露cache line概念（需手动padding）；Leviathan的actor接口隐藏硬件细节。对比Livia：task-offload无probabilistic migration和streaming；Leviathan扩展接口覆盖所有范式。

