## Morph (Data-triggered Address Range Registration)

术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Morph<T>是Leviathan (MICRO 2024) 为Data-triggered NDC设计的address range registration和管理construct。Morph封装phantom data address range的全局状态和per-engine local state。Application通过`Morph<T>::register(morphType, cacheLevel, numActors)`注册Morph，Leviathan硬件在所有cache controller中注册该address range——后续对该range内数据的cache miss/eviction自动触发T类型actor的constructor/destructor。Morph的核心价值：将data-triggered abstraction从cache line级别提升到object级别——programmer仅实现单object的constructor/destructor，Morph管理object到cache line的packing/alignment。

从系统架构角度拆解：
Morph在系统中的生命周期：
```
// 注册
Morph<Pixel>::register(DECOMPRESS, L2, numPixels);
  → Allocator为numPixels保留contiguous phantom address range
  → TLB entries更新Morph bits (L2 level)
  → 每engine创建local Morph view: {actors_ptr, size, engine-local state}
  → vtable cache per engine: address range→Morph methods

// Runtime: cache miss on Pixel at L2
  → L2 controller查TLB bits: Morph registered→触发insertion
  → Event→data-triggered scheduler: {phys_addr, L2, INSERTION}
  → rTLB翻译phys→virt; vtable lookup定位Morph→Pixel constructor
  → 对cache line内每个object并行调用constructor
  → Constructor通过Morph view指针访问engine-local state

// 注销
Morph<Pixel>::unregister(m);
  → Flush ISA: flush所有phantom data→触发destructors
  → TLB bits cleared
```

术语一般如何实现？如何使用？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。
Morph实现要点：(1) Morph<T> base class——存储padded actors base pointer, size, per-engine Morph views数组；(2) Morph views——每engine一个copy，含engine-local state（因不同engine处理同一Morph的不同object子集）；(3) register参数：morphType枚举、cacheLevel（L2/LLC）、numActors；(4) getActor/getOffset——core侧定位actor或action侧反查offset。对比täkō：onMiss/onEviction在cache line级别——programmer需手工解析line内object layout；Leviathan的Morph constructor/destructor在object级别——small objects并行处理，large objects单action处理多line。

